# Forgejo #122 implementation verification

## Test-first red state

Command:
`npm test -- src/core/manifold.test.ts src/state/store.test.ts`

Result before the production edit: 3 failed, 213 passed. Both huge core rows
threw from `toIndex` with exact quotients `18014398509481982` and
`18014398509481984`; the store lifecycle row received `invalid` instead of
`solved`.

## Bidirectional clamp mutations

Command:
`npm test -- src/core/manifold.test.ts src/state/store.test.ts -t 'exact feed-entry clamp|huge feed override'`

- Under-clamp mutation (`N - 1`): 4 failed, 212 skipped. Core entries were 2
  instead of 3 and the restored store entry was 19 instead of 20.
- Over-clamp mutation (`N + 1`): 4 failed, 212 skipped. Core entries were 4
  instead of 3 and the restored store entry was 21 instead of 20.

Both mutations were removed before final verification.
